## Point thresholds for tracks to run events. The lesser the more frequent events will be.
<<<<<<< HEAD
MUNDANE_POINT_THRESHOLD 45
MODERATE_POINT_THRESHOLD 85
MAJOR_POINT_THRESHOLD 9999
ROLESET_POINT_THRESHOLD 9999
