## Storyteller types configs
## Uncomment any of these configs to adjust the point thresholds for any storyteller.
## The ones that don't have a track name attached to them adjust all tracks on the given storyteller.
## These values are being multiplied by the points thresholds, meaning that the higher the numbers here,
## the lower the frequency of events on that storyteller/track of a storyteller.
## Default value for all of those is 1, meaning that they do not affect the points thresholds.

## 1. Chill
#CHILL_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#CHILL_MUNDANE_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#CHILL_MODERATE_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#CHILL_MAJOR_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#CHILL_CREWSET_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#CHILL_GHOSTSET_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1

## 2. Fragile
#FRAGILE_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#FRAGILE_MUNDANE_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#FRAGILE_MODERATE_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#FRAGILE_MAJOR_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#FRAGILE_CREWSET_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1
#FRAGILE_GHOSTSET_POINTS_THRESHOLD_COEFFICIENT 1

